<td id="S4.T1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;" colspan="9"><span id="S4.T1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Curriculum training (trained up to Len-<math id="S4.T1.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6FF;" mathbackground="#E6E6FF">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
